<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Travel Tips &amp; Inspiration | Fleypat Adventures</title><meta name="description" content="Helpful ideas for planning safaris, coastal holidays and journeys across East Africa."><meta name="theme-color" content="#a8d832"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css"></head><body><div class="topline"><div class="wrap top-inner"><span>Mombasa, Kenya · Your Adventure Begins Here!</span><span><a href="tel:+254704261626">+254 704 261 626</a> · <a href="mailto:info@fleypatadventures.com">info@fleypatadventures.com</a></span></div></div><header class="header"><div class="wrap nav"><a class="brand" href="index.html"><img src="fleypat-logo.png" alt="Fleypat Adventures logo" onerror="this.style.display='none'"><span>FLEYPAT<small>ADVENTURES</small></span></a><button class="nav-toggle" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false">☰</button><nav><a href="index.html" class="">Home</a><a href="about.html" class="">About</a><a href="safaris.html" class="">Safaris</a><a href="marine-tours.html" class="">Marine Tours</a><a href="day-trips.html" class="">Day Trips</a><a href="beach-holidays.html" class="">Beach Holidays</a><a href="honeymoon.html" class="">Honeymoons</a><a href="destinations.html" class="">Destinations</a><a href="itineraries.html" class="">Itineraries</a><a href="services.html" class="">Services</a><a href="transfers.html" class="">Transfers</a><a href="blog.html" class="active">Blog</a><a href="partnerships.html" class="">Partnerships</a><a href="contact.html" class="">Contact</a><a class="nav-book" href="contact.html">Book Now</a></nav></div></header><main><section class="page-hero" style="--hero-image:url('travel-blog.jpg')"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">Explore with Fleypat</span><h1>Travel Tips & Inspiration</h1><p>Helpful ideas for planning safaris, coastal holidays and journeys across East Africa.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><span class="kicker">Travel with us</span><h2>Explore Your Options</h2><p>Choose an experience below or contact us for a custom proposal.</p></div><div class="grid cols-3"><article class="card"><div class="photo"><img src="what-to-pack-for-a-kenyan-safari.jpg" alt="What to Pack for a Kenyan Safari" loading="lazy"></div><div class="card-content"><span class="mini-tag">Explore</span><h3>What to Pack for a Kenyan Safari</h3><p>Pack for changing weather, outdoor activities and comfortable game viewing.</p><a class="link" href="safaris.html">Discover more →</a></div></article><article class="card"><div class="photo"><img src="planning-a-kenya-coast-holiday.jpg" alt="Planning a Kenya Coast Holiday" loading="lazy"></div><div class="card-content"><span class="mini-tag">Explore</span><h3>Planning a Kenya Coast Holiday</h3><p>Compare coastal destinations, travel time and activities before choosing a base.</p><a class="link" href="beach-holidays.html">Discover more →</a></div></article><article class="card"><div class="photo"><img src="a-first-visit-to-tsavo.jpg" alt="A First Visit to Tsavo" loading="lazy"></div><div class="card-content"><span class="mini-tag">Explore</span><h3>A First Visit to Tsavo</h3><p>Understand the route, park experience and what to confirm before travelling.</p><a class="link" href="destination-tsavo.html">Discover more →</a></div></article><article class="card"><div class="photo"><img src="responsible-wildlife-viewing.jpg" alt="Responsible Wildlife Viewing" loading="lazy"></div><div class="card-content"><span class="mini-tag">Explore</span><h3>Responsible Wildlife Viewing</h3><p>Keep a respectful distance and follow your guide and park rules.</p><a class="link" href="safaris.html">Discover more →</a></div></article></div></div></section><section class="cta wrap"><div><h2>Ready to plan your next adventure?</h2><p>Tell us what you have in mind and we will prepare a tailored travel proposal.</p></div><a class="btn btn-gold" href="contact.html">Make an Enquiry</a></section></main><footer class="footer"><div class="wrap footer-grid"><div><a class="brand footer-brand" href="index.html"><img src="fleypat-logo.png" alt="Fleypat Adventures logo" onerror="this.style.display='none'"><span>FLEYPAT<small>ADVENTURES</small></span></a><p>Explore more. Experience more. Travel beyond expectations. Your journey starts with us.</p><a href="https://www.instagram.com/fleypat_adventures/">Instagram @fleypat_adventures</a></div><div><h3>Explore</h3><a href="safaris.html">Wildlife Safaris</a><a href="marine-tours.html">Marine Tours</a><a href="day-trips.html">Day Trips</a><a href="beach-holidays.html">Beach Holidays</a><a href="destinations.html">Destinations</a><a href="itineraries.html">Itineraries</a></div><div><h3>Company</h3><a href="about.html">About Us</a><a href="services.html">Our Services</a><a href="transfers.html">Transfers</a><a href="partnerships.html">Partnerships</a><a href="blog.html">Travel Guides</a></div><div><h3>Contact</h3><a href="tel:+254704261626">+254 704 261 626</a><a href="mailto:info@fleypatadventures.com">info@fleypatadventures.com</a><a href="https://wa.me/254704261626">WhatsApp our team</a><span>Mombasa, Kenya</span></div></div><div class="wrap foot-bottom">© <span data-year></span> Fleypat Adventures. All rights reserved.<span>Explore More. Experience More. Travel Beyond Expectations.</span></div></footer><a class="float-wa" href="https://wa.me/254704261626?text=Hello%20Fleypat%20Adventures%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20plan%20a%20trip." target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp Us</a><script src="script.js"></script></body></html>
